{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55479","headline":"题常州忠烈王庙 · 任右元","name":"题常州忠烈王庙","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"松竹萧萧野笛悲，寂寥冰雪对旌旗。\n前山月夜阴风起，神去神来人不知。\n（见《增修诗话总龟》卷十五引《郡阁雅谈》、《咸淳毗陵志》卷二十二。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"任右元","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55479.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55479","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}